{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/5a8ec38963e947b733b5136b13c8f213.webp?t=1759930254\" width=452 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/21e55ba8b7fba3de1c9f36e9e3c7aad9.poster.avif?t=1759930254\" width=622 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/21e55ba8b7fba3de1c9f36e9e3c7aad9.webm?t=1759930254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your trusty d6 and journey into a dreamy \u201990s-infused turn-based roguelike. Create wild synergies with loads of unlockable gear and roll for victory in snappy 30-minute runs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/1d8dcece484e7bbf4d600aabe82785a1.webp?t=1759930254\" width=452 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/0f3ea3be54093c7e8b613ad7f0705d8d.poster.avif?t=1759930254\" width=622 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/0f3ea3be54093c7e8b613ad7f0705d8d.webm?t=1759930254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft <strong>degenerate combos</strong> to break the game with <strong>new</strong> <strong>unlocks</strong> every time you wake up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four playable classes to conquer your dream foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 equipment cards to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 memories to make battles easier\u2026 or weirder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 different snacks to boost your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 30 minute runs, try every combination</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/42c8541499c7d8e3a2d91f1b7da6e89a.webp?t=1759930254\" width=452 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And decorate it with nostalgic \u201990s memorabilia. Retro video games, rad movie posters, sick skateboards \u2013 everything you need to survive Y2K.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/15308df9449ecb8d4f02fdb7bc8d06b1.poster.avif?t=1759930254\" width=622 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/15308df9449ecb8d4f02fdb7bc8d06b1.webm?t=1759930254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038470?t=1759930254","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/8ec283ee9b9c6e347dfc66faef5603ed82ea4019/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759930254","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/1b3d812df93a840eb208428a91bdece14f2bbd68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759930254","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/1b3d812df93a840eb208428a91bdece14f2bbd68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759930254","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom V