 game with <strong>new</strong> <strong>unlocks</strong> every time you wake up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four playable classes to conquer your dream foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 equipment cards to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 memories to make battles easier\u2026 or weirder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 different snacks to boost your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 30 minute runs, try every combination</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/42c8541499c7d8e3a2d91f1b7da6e89a.webp?t=1759930254\" width=452 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And decorate it with nostalgic \u201990s memorabilia. Retro video games, rad movie posters, sick skateboards \u2013 everything you need to survive Y2K.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/15308df9449ecb8d4f02fdb7bc8d06b1.poster.avif?t=1759930254\" width=622 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/extras/15308df9449ecb8d4f02fdb7bc8d06b1.webm?t=1759930254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Chugga Chugga LLC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3325390","name":"Slumber Realm"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038470/9364ceaa0e424b7856734ee69ef70116838a1c52/header.jpg?t=1759930254","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025, Chugga Chugga LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>